{
  "name": "Blaster",
  "type": "archetypes",
  "img": "icons/svg/statue.svg",
  "system": {
    "description": "<section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block scrpg-archetype-block-intro\"><p>No need to mess around, the best way to use energy is to throw it at the bad guy.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Powers/Qualities</div><p>Assign one of the dice you rolled at the end of the power source step to an Elemental/Energy power. If you already have an Elemental/Energy power, you can skip it, add a different Elemental/Energy power, or swap the die with one of your new dice.</p><p>Assign one of your remaining dice to one of these powers:</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.fubw8CJu2mXFZJUD]{Signature Weaponry}</p><p>• Select from Elemental/Energy powers category</p><p>• Select from Mobility powers category</p><p>• Select from Technological powers category</p><p>Assign any remaining dice to any of these qualities:</p><p>• Select from Mental qualities category</p><p>• Select from Physical qualities category</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Abilities</div><p>Gain two of the following Green abilities, each of which uses a different one of your powers from the Blaster list above:</p><ul class=\"scrpg-archetype-ability-links\"><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.Ubn9ICW0nav4sohJ]{Exploit Vulnerability}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.0tuiErxFx9m93ppy]{Disabling Blast}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.r9yE0hFtMQ3Ce4DQ]{Danger Zone}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.0zBbd2gGhD9wumb9]{Precise Hit}</li></ul><p>Gain two of these Yellow abilities, using two different powers:</p><ul class=\"scrpg-archetype-ability-links\"><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.GdsqrHseLVijGsRS]{Energy Immunity}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.sjIIxiqRtgBLoS5R]{Heedless Blast}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.PMBEHxkUXPyGqKet]{Imbue with Element}</li></ul></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Principle</div><p>Choose an Esoteric principle.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Personality</div><p>Roll d10, d10 for personality selection.</p></section>"
